WEBVTT


00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:30.047
Speed on!


00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:35.204
There it is!


00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.798
Take the road!


00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:15.524
Stop there!


00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.925
Stop, I said!


00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:25.082
I'm not a wild boar.
I am your emperor Frederick of Hohenstaufen.


00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:30.723
Are You "Barbarossa"?


00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:36.726
Will I be called like this.
Who are you?


00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:40.523
My name is Alberto da Giussano.


00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:44.768
Son of Giovanni, wrought from Milan.


00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.404
Well, smith...


00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:52.399
Take this dagger.
It will serve you when you grow up.


00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:58.241
The Emperor is suit!


00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:27.965
I do not know whether it is wise.


00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:33.767
Hildegard of Bingen is an accomplished
seamstress who can see through people.


00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:40.125
As a 5 year old she could describe
an unborn calf to the letter.


00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.729
They make their own music.


00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:12.604
Calf had died inside the uterus.


00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.890
Why have you come here?


00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:23.285
My hosts are here to ask for your advice.


00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:27.198
He is getting married tomorrow and was wondering...


00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.924
The wedding is blessed.


00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:35.727
Innocence tree is not mature yet,
but the roots are strong.


00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.202
She will bear fruit.


00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.242
Come closer...


00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:45.167
They...


00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:52.124
Who is pretending to be king among kings.


00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:09.370
Is it written in my fate.
I have to reunite the empire?


00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:14.518
Listen to what I say, Frederick of Swabia ...


00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:22.688
Their name will be remembered for centuries.


00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:28.161
But beware...


00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:32.962
Beware of the water.


00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:37.726
Beware of the sword.


00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:41.843
With the sword comes defeat.


00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:46.282
With water comes death.


00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:55.445
Beware of the water.


00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.841
Here comes the future empress.


00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:33.883
I hope she makes my cousin
happier than his first wife.


00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:38.845
She could not endure his love
or give him children.


00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.609
We hope everyone.


00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:46.565
His Majesty has been waiting
for an heir long enough.


00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:52.729
He must wait a while yet.


00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:59.039
He can console himself with the fact
that Beatrix comes with all Burgundy.


00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:06.887
- Who is it that Eugenie?
- Henry of Saxony.


00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:10.161
He is the emperor's cousin.


00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:13.999
He is called the "Lion".


00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:17.486
Leo Henry...


00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:36.010
She is prettier than the first.


00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:40.681
- She's only a child!
- I did not know she was so young.


00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:44.120
She should at least be able to have babies.


00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:50.365
The French girl seems promising.


00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:57.125
She apparently can even read.


00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:18.048
My dad will kill me.


00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:23.162
- You're wet. What have you done?
- I will not talk about it.


00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:27.841
- Evandro would leave without you.
- Sorry, Dad.


00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:33.727
- We must reach the river before dusk.
- Sorry, Evandro.


00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:43.325
Join them!


00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:48.201
- Lodi citizens still sleeping.
- It's probably good.


00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.969
Did you hear that?


00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:58.522
- Hurry, Give me them!
- Looking at it!


00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:02.165
How many fine products.


00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:05.160
Check them.


00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:23.448
What do you want?
We are not on your land.


00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:27.722
Not right now, but they passed it before.


00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:31.809
It should I pay for.


00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:57.363
On them!
Take it, then I take the other.


00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:15.642
Hurry, Alberto!


00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:33.283
Does he know you love him?


00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.286
Of course not.


00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:42.722
Rainero since Giussano
is too shy and a bit stupid ...


00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:48.243
If he waits too long,
the others swarm about you.


00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.445
And you?


00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:58.281
Nobody wants me, but it's alright.


00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:02.562
I can not love anyone other than him.


00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:12.401
Alberto!


00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.326
You too compassionate end!


00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:22.085
Tessa!


00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:11.242
Milanese, exploiting every chance
to show their superiority.


00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:15.409
We find this disturbing, your majesty.


00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:17.725
That's why we've come.


00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:22.844
The city of Lodi has always
been your majesty faith.


00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:27.725
Now it needs the emperor's help.


00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:34.962
Milanese is being arrogant.


00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:38.639
It is time to remind them of
how sharply the Emperor's sword.


00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:42.729
We can go south already in two weeks.


00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:45.410
No!


00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:48.681
We do not go on the attack yet.


00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:52.564
If the North within you...


00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:56.444
They are the mightiest in Europe.


00:15:56.570 --> 00:16:01.519
I write a letter and
advises them to calm down.


00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:04.369
I shall deliver it.


00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:27.644
The Emperor warns you against attacking Lodi.


00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:31.319
Otherwise, Milan banned.


00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:39.764
Gherardo!


00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.159
Here you have our answer.


00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:48.683
They have gone too far.
It's going to regret you.


00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:52.519
- What have you done?
- Wait, Rainald.


00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:56.803
Your Excellency!


00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:02.369
What should we do now?


00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:06.722
Put together an army.
We go on the attack against Lodi.


00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.640
My goodness...


00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.839
Alberto...


00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:33.881
Alberto da Giussano...


00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.882
Smith Sun


00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:44.562
It was not part of our agreement, did it?


00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:57.638
We succeeded, Alberto!
Lodi would pay for his insolence.


00:18:57.770 --> 00:19:03.288
- Are you already back?
- Do you fool? You've slept in 4 days.


00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:06.368
We defeated Lodi.
They have had to pay.


00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:10.847
- Come on, we celebrate it out there.
- Come on!


00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:20.967
They are ready.


00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:24.609
They had no choice, your grace.


00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:31.162
They seem to force me to go to war,
though I will have peace.


00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:36.284
I know, but you must go to Italy.


00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:42.724
Milanese want autonomy,
but the dream of the great empire.


00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:46.399
Crush them.
Hugs Milan, your grace!


00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:52.608
A prophecy came to my ear
just before we married.


00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.164
It was about a sword and water.


00:19:55.290 --> 00:20:00.080
The sword came with defeat,
and the waters of death.


00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:04.567
Was it a prophecy or witchcraft?


00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:08.649
I also have a prophecy for you.


00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:13.719
As an queen I predict that
you will triumph in Italy.


00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:20.323
In the properties of your wife,
I predict that you will miss me.


00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:46.964
The dogs are restless.
afraid of thunder.


00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:53.370
It is not thunder, they are afraid.
There is someone out there.


00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:05.400
My goodness, where did you fear me!


00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:08.090
What are you doing out in this weather?


00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:12.127
I will talk to you. In private.


00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:22.567
- I listen.
- I'm going north toward Barbarossa.


00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:27.322
I knew already.


00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:31.248
Yes, but the thing is...


00:22:33.010 --> 00:22:37.162
I have two women in the house,
who are you looking for?


00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:41.442
I will ask Tessa hand.


00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:46.167
Tessa...


00:22:47.290 --> 00:22:53.923
Tessa is married mature, so this
may well be the start of something good.


00:22:54.050 --> 00:22:58.919
- Will you talk to her?
- Yes. I argue your wishes.


00:22:59.050 --> 00:23:02.725
- I have planned it all.
- It's understood.


00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:06.005
I return.


00:23:20.530 --> 00:23:22.885
Now we finally advanced.


00:23:23.010 --> 00:23:28.004
They must conquer this part
if you intend to reach Sicily.


00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:33.887
Rome is located right in the middle.
This will not be easy.


00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:37.366
Rome is weakened.
Wait some time yet.


00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:42.761
How long then?


00:23:42.890 --> 00:23:48.169
The stubborn Englishman,
Pope Hadrian IV, is soon dead.


00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:51.566
His successor is said to be
considerably more docile.


00:23:51.690 --> 00:23:57.083
They will soon sit on the throne
that belonged to Charlemagne.


00:23:58.770 --> 00:24:01.000
We continue.


00:24:18.090 --> 00:24:20.001
I got you!


00:24:31.210 --> 00:24:36.284
Siniscalco Barozzi came home
to us yesterday evening.


00:24:36.410 --> 00:24:40.688
- He asked for my sister Tessa's hand.
- Barozzi is a creep.


00:24:43.210 --> 00:24:47.283
He is never going to marry my sister.


00:24:47.410 --> 00:24:50.482
How can you know?


00:24:53.250 --> 00:24:56.686
I can feel it.


00:24:57.810 --> 00:25:02.725
So is it true what they say.
That you are a kind of witch.


00:25:05.970 --> 00:25:08.040
Wait...


00:25:08.170 --> 00:25:10.001
Wait!


00:25:11.330 --> 00:25:14.083
I got something for you.


00:25:22.570 --> 00:25:27.246
With this vagina,
I take care of you the rest of my life.


00:25:27.370 --> 00:25:31.761
With dagger I defend you with my life.


00:25:34.690 --> 00:25:37.284
What?


00:25:39.090 --> 00:25:41.843
What's wrong?


00:25:58.330 --> 00:26:02.164
Eleonora...Do you sleep?


00:26:03.890 --> 00:26:05.881
No.


00:26:07.210 --> 00:26:10.441
I'll show you something.


00:26:10.570 --> 00:26:12.720
Look here...


00:26:18.490 --> 00:26:24.725
- Has he finally decided?
- Rainero has given me his promise.


00:26:31.570 --> 00:26:34.004
Do not say anything to Dad.


00:26:34.690 --> 00:26:39.445
He feels that Siniscalco Barozzi
is a suitable candidate.


00:26:39.570 --> 00:26:42.607
He may be consulted.


00:26:42.730 --> 00:26:47.201
It is not him who is forced
to share a bed with Barozzi.


00:26:52.010 --> 00:26:57.084
Listen to your heart, Tessa.
What you do.


00:26:57.210 --> 00:27:01.283
Sleep now! There is also a tomorrow.


00:27:05.290 --> 00:27:08.566
My heart has already decided.


00:27:09.810 --> 00:27:12.927
So this is how it should be.


00:27:25.970 --> 00:27:27.483
My goodness!


00:27:36.050 --> 00:27:38.120
They can go into.


00:27:49.090 --> 00:27:52.924
I have come to speak to the emperor.


00:27:53.050 --> 00:27:57.680
They must be content with talking to me.


00:28:01.050 --> 00:28:04.679
I think Milan and hollow cupboard.


00:28:04.810 --> 00:28:09.679
- Milano has a short memory.
- Now I'm not quite.


00:28:09.810 --> 00:28:15.601
They were present when the
Milanese Officers stomped on the letter.


00:28:15.730 --> 00:28:20.485
I was humbled and humiliated by your rabble.


00:28:20.610 --> 00:28:23.363
I am here to apologize.


00:28:24.410 --> 00:28:27.368
Our conversation is over.


00:28:27.490 --> 00:28:30.846
Greet your consuls and
say that the emperor comes...


00:28:30.970 --> 00:28:33.438
And it is no courtesy visit.


00:28:33.570 --> 00:28:37.563
Many nobles of Milan is at the Emperor's side.


00:28:37.690 --> 00:28:40.602
They have done what they can, Barozzi.


00:28:45.530 --> 00:28:49.000
It stays here.


00:28:54.410 --> 00:28:57.846
It's true. I'm afraid.


00:28:57.970 --> 00:29:04.887
I've even seen what the German army can inflict.


00:29:07.650 --> 00:29:11.848
Their tent covered the entire field.


00:29:11.970 --> 00:29:15.599
They had so many war machines...


00:29:17.210 --> 00:29:21.920
That they would not even fit on our square!


00:29:25.730 --> 00:29:29.325
I implore you...


00:29:29.450 --> 00:29:32.010
To capitulate.


00:29:32.770 --> 00:29:36.649
- Capitulate!
- No, we must fight!


00:29:38.890 --> 00:29:41.450
Barbarossa's army is here soon.


00:29:44.050 --> 00:29:49.329
Milan's day can be counted on one hand.


00:30:01.810 --> 00:30:07.043
Every time we come here,
they build a new, stronger bridge for us.


00:30:14.130 --> 00:30:16.928
Verona people respect tradition.


00:30:17.050 --> 00:30:23.489
When the German king comes,
they are obliged to build a bridge.


00:30:23.610 --> 00:30:25.965
We respect them for that.


00:30:33.090 --> 00:30:37.163
Your Majesty!
What is it going?


00:30:37.290 --> 00:30:40.839
Beware of tree trunks!


00:30:40.970 --> 00:30:42.847
Stop!


00:31:02.130 --> 00:31:05.042
Tie the rope tight!


00:31:10.210 --> 00:31:12.246
It's a trap!


00:31:14.610 --> 00:31:16.919
Help him up!


00:31:18.210 --> 00:31:23.887
No, your majesty!
Think of the prophecy of water and death.


00:31:24.010 --> 00:31:26.683
Help emperor!


00:31:34.610 --> 00:31:36.885
Take the rope!


00:31:39.090 --> 00:31:42.321
He is under water! Dive!


00:31:43.570 --> 00:31:45.128
No...


00:31:45.250 --> 00:31:47.400
Find him!


00:31:47.530 --> 00:31:49.680
Dive!


00:31:54.530 --> 00:31:56.885
No...My goodness!


00:32:07.730 --> 00:32:09.527
Give me your hand!


00:32:26.890 --> 00:32:29.882
What I have done is very serious.


00:32:30.010 --> 00:32:32.843
In and Milan have gone against the Empire.


00:32:32.970 --> 00:32:37.327
I have robbed many German soldiers.


00:32:37.450 --> 00:32:42.399
I have not respected the custom,
which has saved Verona past.


00:32:42.530 --> 00:32:45.044
How can it be?


00:32:45.170 --> 00:32:50.119
It is an important day,
and there is one thing I must know.


00:32:50.250 --> 00:32:53.765
One can only betray his emperor once.


00:32:57.810 --> 00:33:00.802
I'm just so cruel...


00:33:00.930 --> 00:33:03.490
God is good.


00:33:09.090 --> 00:33:11.081
Alberto!


00:33:11.210 --> 00:33:13.201
Alberto!


00:33:14.570 --> 00:33:19.360
Barbarossa has crushed Brescia!
More than one thousand have died.


00:33:19.490 --> 00:33:23.642
How do you know?
Have you had a revelation again?


00:33:23.770 --> 00:33:28.844
What do you want us to do?
Should we let the Germans win?


00:33:29.810 --> 00:33:35.282
It would make no difference.
We are and remain slaves.


00:33:35.410 --> 00:33:38.163
We will not be slaves anymore.


00:33:39.770 --> 00:33:44.366
- They have already lost this war.
- Enough is enough!


00:33:44.490 --> 00:33:48.324
Our duty is to defend our city...


00:33:48.450 --> 00:33:52.523
And your duty is to sit home
and wait for your man!


00:33:52.650 --> 00:33:54.800
If you then have one.


00:34:04.210 --> 00:34:08.567
- Do not use this to her again.
- Alberto!


00:34:09.610 --> 00:34:11.840
Enough is enough.


00:34:43.930 --> 00:34:45.966
There they are.


00:34:56.970 --> 00:34:58.926
Wonderful.


00:35:09.490 --> 00:35:15.486
How many cities, we must crush
before they come to their senses?


00:35:15.610 --> 00:35:18.522
Just one more. We crushes Milan.


00:35:18.650 --> 00:35:23.644
So will other cities follow
their shepherd like frightened sheep.


00:35:23.770 --> 00:35:28.844
Milan, Milan, Milan...


00:35:30.010 --> 00:35:32.649
Parma greet the Emperor!


00:35:32.770 --> 00:35:35.364
Cremona greet the Emperor!


00:35:35.490 --> 00:35:38.129
Padua greet the Emperor!


00:35:38.250 --> 00:35:40.684
Ferrara greet the Emperor!


00:35:40.810 --> 00:35:45.520
What burns the most of?
Being able to fight for the empire ...


00:35:45.650 --> 00:35:48.642
Or to contribute to Milan's downfall?


00:35:48.770 --> 00:35:53.127
They are sheep Rainald.
They do not think.


00:35:53.250 --> 00:35:56.925
They just need to obey the emperor.


00:36:25.530 --> 00:36:28.328
- Did you hear that?
- It sounded like thunder.


00:36:28.450 --> 00:36:32.887
It is not thunder. It sounds like...


00:36:34.050 --> 00:36:37.008
Look over there!


00:36:37.130 --> 00:36:39.280
Barbarossa!


00:36:39.410 --> 00:36:41.605
Barbarossa!


00:36:43.290 --> 00:36:46.760
Barbarossa! Barbarossa!


00:36:53.690 --> 00:36:55.965
Hurry!


00:37:29.930 --> 00:37:33.206
It is the largest army, I've seen.


00:37:33.330 --> 00:37:34.888
Come, Alberto.


00:37:39.370 --> 00:37:41.088
Alberto!


00:37:41.210 --> 00:37:43.883
Hurry, Alberto!


00:37:54.530 --> 00:37:57.363
Hurry!


00:37:58.410 --> 00:38:00.844
What?


00:38:00.970 --> 00:38:04.406
Do not let them fight.


00:38:06.170 --> 00:38:10.129
I saw the arrows...
You must prevent it!


00:38:10.250 --> 00:38:14.323
The Germans are out there.
There are arrows everywhere.


00:38:14.450 --> 00:38:19.478
- What are you talking about?
- It was not German arrows.


00:38:50.970 --> 00:38:54.565
We are ready as soon as the sun rises.


00:38:54.690 --> 00:38:59.844
- How many war machines do we have?
- About a hundred.


00:38:59.970 --> 00:39:03.440
The tower is unfortunately too far away.


00:39:03.570 --> 00:39:07.085
- Can we not go further?
- No, your majesty.


00:39:07.210 --> 00:39:10.759
Milanese has built a moat around the city.


00:39:10.890 --> 00:39:13.450
Machines can not come closer...


00:39:13.570 --> 00:39:18.280
Wise move. Do you have any suggestions?


00:39:18.410 --> 00:39:23.245
I think we should concentrate
on crossbows masons...


00:39:23.370 --> 00:39:27.124
While we fill the moat with earth.


00:39:28.170 --> 00:39:35.087
Milanese feel safe within the city walls.


00:39:35.210 --> 00:39:39.726
They must be detained there,
and we block all exits.


00:39:39.850 --> 00:39:45.049
They are going to starve,
and if they do not give up...


00:39:45.170 --> 00:39:48.003
Is the city their tomb.


00:39:48.130 --> 00:39:50.360
Press!


00:39:54.370 --> 00:39:56.440
Put them in place!


00:39:56.570 --> 00:40:01.041
- They are preparing an attack!
- Take cover!


00:40:03.130 --> 00:40:04.961
Fire!


00:40:08.090 --> 00:40:09.603
Take cover!


00:40:21.250 --> 00:40:23.559
Throw the barrels down!


00:40:25.650 --> 00:40:28.323
Roll the drums!


00:40:35.330 --> 00:40:38.049
They throw barrels into the water.


00:40:41.530 --> 00:40:44.442
They try to get closer to the tower!


00:40:46.410 --> 00:40:48.321
Hurry!


00:40:49.130 --> 00:40:51.405
Fire!


00:40:52.610 --> 00:40:54.601
Fire!


00:41:04.170 --> 00:41:06.889
Do not let them rest.


00:41:07.010 --> 00:41:10.161
We deprive them of all food and rest.


00:41:10.290 --> 00:41:12.850
They become more and more debilitated.


00:41:25.010 --> 00:41:28.480
Guy and leave again!


00:41:43.850 --> 00:41:46.239
Take cover! Hurry!


00:42:02.450 --> 00:42:05.010
Hurry, faster!


00:42:08.970 --> 00:42:11.279
Against the wall! Speed on!


00:42:11.410 --> 00:42:14.083
Grab!


00:42:16.930 --> 00:42:18.966
Take cover!


00:42:36.970 --> 00:42:39.848
Races...Fast!


00:42:44.370 --> 00:42:46.247
Hither!


00:42:46.370 --> 00:42:48.486
Stop!


00:42:51.410 --> 00:42:55.164
Download some rock! Hurry!


00:42:56.450 --> 00:42:59.567
50 meters from the wall!


00:42:59.690 --> 00:43:02.079
Are you ready?


00:43:03.170 --> 00:43:05.047
Fire!


00:43:11.370 --> 00:43:13.247
Fire!


00:43:20.530 --> 00:43:27.959
We need one volunteer per family
can go and get food.


00:43:28.090 --> 00:43:30.320
Who goes?


00:43:30.450 --> 00:43:32.680
You, you...


00:43:32.810 --> 00:43:34.641
Yes.


00:43:42.370 --> 00:43:47.444
I saw no young Rainero
since Giussano his arm up.


00:43:47.570 --> 00:43:52.246
Let him alone, Barozzi.
His brother Otto and I'm here.


00:43:52.370 --> 00:43:55.168
- Choose one of us instead.
- Well...


00:43:55.290 --> 00:44:00.205
Since your brother apparently
did not feel like I should go instead.


00:44:00.330 --> 00:44:02.719
No!


00:44:03.850 --> 00:44:09.322
No one should say Rainero
since Giussano was scared.


00:44:09.450 --> 00:44:12.806
One per family, he said.


00:44:12.930 --> 00:44:17.481
We will not stop a young man
to show how brave he is.


00:44:21.090 --> 00:44:24.685
Come near Sant 'Ambrogio in half an hour.


00:44:36.730 --> 00:44:39.642
Get your weapons.


00:44:39.770 --> 00:44:42.728
You decide not to me!


00:44:42.850 --> 00:44:46.240
Do not tell me what I should do.


00:44:55.410 --> 00:44:57.799
Close the gate!


00:45:05.090 --> 00:45:07.729
Be careful.


00:45:49.810 --> 00:45:54.759
Tessa...They should be back now.
I fear the worst.


00:45:54.890 --> 00:45:58.360
I pray that there has them something.


00:45:58.490 --> 00:46:03.280
Whatever happens,
I will always take care of you.


00:46:03.410 --> 00:46:06.447
- You're not alone.
- Do not touch me!


00:46:07.450 --> 00:46:12.319
My heart belongs Rainero
since Giussano forever.


00:46:12.450 --> 00:46:17.888
If he does not come back,
I would rather die than live with you.


00:46:20.170 --> 00:46:22.081
Can you hear it?


00:46:25.770 --> 00:46:28.489
The Germans have stopped shooting.


00:46:28.610 --> 00:46:32.523
Hurry! The Germans attack!


00:46:32.650 --> 00:46:34.368
Tessa!


00:46:48.530 --> 00:46:51.408
Germans go on the attack.


00:46:54.610 --> 00:46:57.124
They are approaching!


00:46:57.250 --> 00:47:00.720
- Can not you see them?
- They have stretched them onto the tower.


00:47:00.850 --> 00:47:04.047
What are you waiting for? Shoot!


00:47:08.370 --> 00:47:12.807
Don't mind us! Shoot!


00:47:15.410 --> 00:47:20.689
- What should we do, Alberto?
- Shoot, before it's too late!


00:47:20.810 --> 00:47:25.520
No, Barozzi!
We can not kill our own!


00:47:27.050 --> 00:47:29.405
- Alberto!
- I do not know!


00:47:29.530 --> 00:47:33.762
What is it that sits on the tower?


00:47:35.250 --> 00:47:37.605
No. Do not look!


00:47:39.850 --> 00:47:42.887
Get them out of here!


00:47:43.010 --> 00:47:47.686
Don't do it!
I ask you so amicably.


00:47:47.810 --> 00:47:52.600
- Do not!
- We can't shoot our own!


00:48:00.730 --> 00:48:03.164
No, Alberto!


00:48:05.770 --> 00:48:08.603
I'll shoot!


00:48:17.210 --> 00:48:20.839
Shoot! Don't mind us!


00:48:20.970 --> 00:48:24.645
- No, Alberto!
- Do not look.


00:48:24.770 --> 00:48:27.728
Shoot!


00:48:27.850 --> 00:48:30.125
No, I'm asking ...


00:48:30.250 --> 00:48:32.718
- Don't shoot!
- Shoot!


00:48:53.730 --> 00:48:55.448
Father!


00:48:55.570 --> 00:48:58.846
- We must take cover.
- Hurry!


00:49:12.330 --> 00:49:14.719
Retreat!


00:49:14.850 --> 00:49:17.603
They retire.


00:49:17.730 --> 00:49:21.359
- How could you!
- Take her away!


00:49:21.490 --> 00:49:23.958
Poor baby ...


00:49:24.090 --> 00:49:26.558
Antonia, I beg you.


00:49:55.490 --> 00:49:58.004
The coast is clear.


00:50:51.450 --> 00:50:56.444
- I killed my brother Otto.
- Take it easy.


00:50:56.570 --> 00:50:59.130
It was not your fault.


00:51:18.010 --> 00:51:20.444
Forgive me.


00:51:20.570 --> 00:51:22.765
I killed Otto!


00:51:25.730 --> 00:51:28.767
Father...Feel this knife.


00:51:28.890 --> 00:51:30.881
Feel it.


00:51:32.530 --> 00:51:37.729
I kill the man who killed my brothers.


00:51:37.850 --> 00:51:41.047
I put the knife in his heart.


00:51:51.170 --> 00:51:53.559
- Alberto!
- Leave me in peace.


00:51:53.690 --> 00:51:57.126
Sufficiently many women
have lost their husbands.


00:51:57.250 --> 00:52:01.129
- I just need to inspect the walls.
- I know where you're going.


00:52:01.250 --> 00:52:04.879
I can see in your eyes where you're headed.


00:52:05.010 --> 00:52:11.279
Don't talk about women who have lost
their husbands. My brothers are dead!


00:52:11.410 --> 00:52:15.483
I tried to stop you.


00:52:15.610 --> 00:52:17.726
Why did you?


00:52:22.450 --> 00:52:25.283
I tried to protect you.


00:52:28.290 --> 00:52:33.523
Is this how you protect the people?
By denying their feelings?


00:52:33.650 --> 00:52:37.962
- You do not understand.
- I know what I feel.


00:52:41.530 --> 00:52:44.806
If you love me...


00:52:45.850 --> 00:52:49.126
If you love me, do not leave me.


00:52:52.610 --> 00:52:54.760
Leave me alone.


00:53:45.970 --> 00:53:50.566
- Where did you get hold of the dagger?
- They gave it to me.


00:53:50.690 --> 00:53:52.840
It is some time ago.


00:53:55.970 --> 00:53:59.167
You are smith Sun


00:54:02.010 --> 00:54:06.845
How dare you come here?
You must pay with your life.


00:54:06.970 --> 00:54:09.404
I'm not afraid.


00:54:09.530 --> 00:54:14.763
There are hundreds of others
who are prepared to implement this.


00:54:14.890 --> 00:54:18.803
Your city is consumed within a few days.


00:54:18.930 --> 00:54:22.684
Many more will die before then.


00:54:24.690 --> 00:54:26.806
I remember you.


00:54:26.930 --> 00:54:32.004
I have thought much of you
since you saved my life...


00:54:32.130 --> 00:54:35.520
And took a seat in my destiny.


00:54:36.850 --> 00:54:39.489
I ought to summon the guards...


00:54:43.850 --> 00:54:46.922
But I will not.


00:54:49.010 --> 00:54:51.888
I let you go.


00:54:56.610 --> 00:55:00.728
Their days are numbered, old king.


00:55:08.290 --> 00:55:10.850
Damn you.


00:55:49.410 --> 00:55:52.607
- Alberto!
- Father...


00:55:55.170 --> 00:55:59.686
- Where are your daughters?
- I can not tell.


00:56:01.610 --> 00:56:06.240
I promised Eleonora not telling
where she was going.


00:56:06.370 --> 00:56:09.089
And especially not to you, Alberto.


00:56:09.210 --> 00:56:12.008
The Germans are here!


00:56:12.130 --> 00:56:14.724
Who has opened the door?


00:56:26.850 --> 00:56:28.727
Move you!


00:56:29.970 --> 00:56:34.202
- There has been shed enough blood.
- Guitelmo!


00:56:34.330 --> 00:56:40.963
- Tessa was not home.
- Beware, Siniscalco Barozzi!


00:56:41.090 --> 00:56:44.844
Even the darkest dogs can be seen
in the torches glow.


00:56:44.970 --> 00:56:48.167
This dog has teeth.


00:56:48.290 --> 00:56:51.407
Before the farmers away.


00:56:53.290 --> 00:56:55.440
Before them away!


00:56:56.890 --> 00:56:59.404
- Come on!
- I kill you!


00:56:59.530 --> 00:57:04.160
I kill you, whether it's
the last thing I do.


00:57:15.530 --> 00:57:19.921
Milan has fallen.
Road to Sicily lies open.


00:57:20.050 --> 00:57:25.283
Soon Charlemagne's empire yours.


00:58:07.010 --> 00:58:11.322
How goes it for those
who rebel against Caesar.


00:58:13.010 --> 00:58:16.844
I order that Milan will be
razed to the ground.


00:58:16.970 --> 00:58:19.564
None of the towers must stand upright.


00:58:19.690 --> 00:58:26.129
I told everyone milan cleaners
to leave the city before sunset.


00:58:26.250 --> 00:58:33.088
Spread you, so nobody can call
themselves milan cleaners.


00:58:33.210 --> 00:58:37.965
The name Milan should be
removed from all maps.


00:59:27.970 --> 00:59:30.165
No.


00:59:43.770 --> 00:59:47.319
I will always be by your side.


00:59:48.250 --> 00:59:51.686
It is the custom here in Burgundy.


00:59:53.810 --> 00:59:57.120
Can you see that he has a dagger on him?


00:59:57.250 --> 01:00:02.165
An armed emperor at his coronation...
It is quite incredible.


01:00:02.290 --> 01:00:08.525
With a crown and a dagger
you can get very far.


01:00:09.290 --> 01:00:15.809
Not least when the Pope,
who crowns Barbarossa is elected by himself.


01:00:27.850 --> 01:00:31.286
Barbarossa! Barbarossa!


01:00:34.530 --> 01:00:38.489
We must revive Rome's heyday.


01:00:38.610 --> 01:00:43.638
They have Rome on their feet
and soon the entire South.


01:00:46.130 --> 01:00:48.598
- Guard!
- Yes, Your Majesty.


01:00:48.730 --> 01:00:52.803
A man has collapsed.
Check what it is about.


01:01:00.730 --> 01:01:03.847
- It's the plague, your majesty.
- My goodness!


01:01:03.970 --> 01:01:06.768
We ride from here!


01:01:12.570 --> 01:01:14.845
Move you!


01:01:26.170 --> 01:01:27.967
Good evening.


01:01:29.050 --> 01:01:35.319
For God's sake, Lorenzo!
Look what has happened.


01:01:35.450 --> 01:01:41.002
We have to meet in secret as outlaws.


01:01:41.130 --> 01:01:43.849
Our people are starving...


01:01:43.970 --> 01:01:48.805
And we have to endure the imperial guards spot.


01:01:48.930 --> 01:01:51.683
They have increased taxes on the crops again!


01:01:51.810 --> 01:01:54.370
We must do something!


01:02:00.570 --> 01:02:02.606
Ro!


01:02:02.730 --> 01:02:05.403
It is pointless to wrangle.


01:02:05.530 --> 01:02:09.648
- What is happening?
- They hold a secret meeting.


01:02:09.770 --> 01:02:11.647
Milan nobility.


01:02:11.770 --> 01:02:17.049
We were starving and had to leave Milan
and go their separate ways.


01:02:17.170 --> 01:02:22.290
- Who is it?
- Negro and dell'Orto.


01:02:22.410 --> 01:02:25.925
Barbarossa has robbed us all.


01:02:26.050 --> 01:02:32.239
Our homes, our work, our pride and dignity.


01:02:33.650 --> 01:02:36.608
We must strike back!


01:02:36.730 --> 01:02:41.804
- We must rebuild the city.
- How could that be?


01:02:41.930 --> 01:02:46.765
I'm just tired faces that don't have
the energy to fight anymore.


01:02:46.890 --> 01:02:50.849
Barbarossa becomes stronger
with every passing day.


01:02:50.970 --> 01:02:55.964
- He is the ruler of Milan.
- He is right in!


01:02:56.090 --> 01:03:01.164
- Lombardy people have accepted it.
- Lower the swords!


01:03:01.290 --> 01:03:03.884
He is with us.


01:03:05.450 --> 01:03:08.089
We can triumph over him...


01:03:09.130 --> 01:03:11.485
If we stand united.


01:03:11.610 --> 01:03:15.159
Listen to what I have to say.


01:03:15.290 --> 01:03:19.727
I can still see how Milan raseres...


01:03:19.850 --> 01:03:24.401
And the people's eyes when
they are forced to leave their homes.


01:03:27.810 --> 01:03:33.248
I feel the anger and consternation
from Barbarossa allies.


01:03:33.370 --> 01:03:39.639
Lombardy fought against Milan and then regret.


01:03:39.770 --> 01:03:44.002
They understood that it was our invited disputes...


01:03:44.130 --> 01:03:47.964
Which made us into slaves under Caesar.


01:03:48.090 --> 01:03:51.924
- Milan would still...
- It's not true!


01:03:52.050 --> 01:03:55.963
Imagine how strong we could be together!


01:03:56.090 --> 01:04:00.845
Think what effect our swords would be capturing.


01:04:02.330 --> 01:04:05.322
You are noble men...


01:04:07.210 --> 01:04:10.441
I must do what is right.


01:04:15.250 --> 01:04:17.889
I'm with you, Alberto.


01:04:19.210 --> 01:04:22.646
- Whatever you want to do.
- Lorenzo...


01:04:22.770 --> 01:04:26.160
The meeting is over. Now we go!


01:04:42.970 --> 01:04:45.165
That's me.


01:04:48.290 --> 01:04:51.965
We had a meeting at the monastery again.


01:04:56.410 --> 01:05:00.039
We have still not decided.


01:05:05.810 --> 01:05:07.926
Alberto...


01:05:24.170 --> 01:05:27.799
- Do you live here alone?
- What does he do here?


01:05:27.930 --> 01:05:32.082
- Alberto...
- Where is your sister...Tessa?


01:05:34.770 --> 01:05:37.330
- Tessa is dead.
- Is it true?


01:05:39.650 --> 01:05:41.288
Is it true?


01:05:41.410 --> 01:05:43.366
What happened?


01:05:44.530 --> 01:05:50.002
Tessa is no longer with us.
It's no use talking about it.


01:05:52.250 --> 01:05:58.598
I ask for your permission
to take your daughter away.


01:05:58.730 --> 01:06:02.643
- She can not stay here alone.
- I feel good here.


01:06:02.770 --> 01:06:05.568
You have my permission.


01:06:11.250 --> 01:06:16.608
- Why did you leave me?
- You did me no harm.


01:06:16.730 --> 01:06:20.803
I was scared and angry.


01:06:21.650 --> 01:06:23.800
Sorry.


01:06:26.370 --> 01:06:29.407
You treated me like an anybody.


01:06:35.050 --> 01:06:38.599
- Antonia!
- Eleonora!


01:06:38.730 --> 01:06:40.925
Eleonora!


01:06:42.330 --> 01:06:45.686
Antonia!
Where am I glad to see you!


01:06:48.050 --> 01:06:50.689
You came back!


01:06:50.810 --> 01:06:53.643
Where is it nice to see you!


01:06:55.610 --> 01:06:57.407
How nice that you're here.


01:06:57.530 --> 01:06:59.486
Emperor's men!


01:07:09.730 --> 01:07:12.198
Take them into.


01:07:17.330 --> 01:07:20.800
- They know why we have come.
- The bastards!


01:07:20.930 --> 01:07:24.445
A third of the crop belongs to Caesar.


01:07:24.570 --> 01:07:26.925
Naturally, your excellency.


01:07:27.050 --> 01:07:31.089
- What have you there?
- It is our forge.


01:07:31.210 --> 01:07:35.681
So great a barn into a blacksmith?


01:07:40.530 --> 01:07:42.486
This I doubt.


01:08:40.130 --> 01:08:45.762
Emperor's men treat us like animals...


01:08:45.890 --> 01:08:49.246
And we give them permission.


01:08:49.370 --> 01:08:52.282
It must have an end now.


01:08:56.810 --> 01:08:59.563
We want our freedom.


01:09:01.570 --> 01:09:03.481
Freedom.


01:09:03.610 --> 01:09:06.568
Do you understand what I mean?


01:09:13.970 --> 01:09:18.168
We are looking for more young men...


01:09:19.250 --> 01:09:22.526
Who are prepared to die for freedom.


01:09:26.450 --> 01:09:28.566
We form an army.


01:09:30.450 --> 01:09:33.726
Help me keep it.


01:09:57.370 --> 01:10:01.807
It should be our symbol.
An iron ring.


01:10:01.930 --> 01:10:04.967
It must unite us all.


01:10:14.770 --> 01:10:17.330
It is a sign from God!


01:10:18.170 --> 01:10:20.206
Hurry!


01:10:26.970 --> 01:10:30.724
Hundreds have died in the epidemic!


01:10:30.850 --> 01:10:33.842
- We live in the least.
- They should get out of here!


01:10:33.970 --> 01:10:38.043
It is bad that the plague
breaks out at your coronation.


01:10:38.170 --> 01:10:42.960
Do not be silly.
That's because just the heat.


01:10:43.090 --> 01:10:46.924
She interrupted the meeting!
It's incredible!


01:10:49.490 --> 01:10:53.927
Everyone says that, unfortunately,
it is a sign from God.


01:10:54.050 --> 01:10:58.646
The coronation was blasphemous and
that Pope Alexander, God's support.


01:10:58.770 --> 01:11:01.762
Stop!


01:11:01.890 --> 01:11:04.529
She interrupted him!


01:11:04.650 --> 01:11:07.722
God is on your side, Fredrik.


01:11:07.850 --> 01:11:11.729
He wants you to become
ruler of the whole earth.


01:11:11.850 --> 01:11:15.684
Continue south.
They can not give up now.


01:11:15.810 --> 01:11:21.965
No, everyone is afraid of the plague,
and we are losing control.


01:11:22.090 --> 01:11:27.084
- We should leave the pestilential town.
- He is right.


01:11:34.170 --> 01:11:36.365
Excellent...


01:11:39.130 --> 01:11:42.884
Tell everyone that we're leaving.


01:11:43.010 --> 01:11:45.285
We're going home.


01:11:48.850 --> 01:11:51.284
That was all.


01:11:52.410 --> 01:11:55.561
Begin preparations for our departure.


01:11:56.690 --> 01:12:00.649
Where is that many poor, Alberto?
Who will want them?


01:12:00.770 --> 01:12:03.807
There are not so many fingers here.


01:12:03.930 --> 01:12:09.004
Well, my friend.
There are many fingers as rings careful.


01:12:10.010 --> 01:12:13.525
I've thought about it for many years.


01:12:14.690 --> 01:12:19.810
Emperor's men exploit fear and death...


01:12:19.930 --> 01:12:23.718
To divide us up and take control.


01:12:26.970 --> 01:12:29.882
Everyone is scared.


01:12:30.010 --> 01:12:35.607
If we could avail ourselves of the fear...


01:12:35.730 --> 01:12:40.599
And get it to unite us...


01:12:41.970 --> 01:12:45.485
We would be invincible.


01:12:45.610 --> 01:12:49.808
What have we to lose? Death?


01:12:52.650 --> 01:12:54.880
Death...


01:12:55.010 --> 01:12:57.763
Death to the Emperor's men!


01:12:59.450 --> 01:13:01.805
Death to the Emperor's men!


01:13:03.730 --> 01:13:06.449
We can call ourselves the death company.


01:13:06.570 --> 01:13:10.199
- Death's company?
- It's a good suggestion.


01:13:10.330 --> 01:13:14.323
- Death's company!
- Death in the name of freedom.


01:13:19.130 --> 01:13:22.008
Death in the name of freedom!


01:13:24.210 --> 01:13:27.122
Death and Freedom, my friend.


01:13:31.810 --> 01:13:35.246
You get into trouble someday.


01:14:03.650 --> 01:14:05.129
There you can just watch!


01:14:05.250 --> 01:14:09.402
Otho! Do you remember me?


01:14:09.530 --> 01:14:12.920
Lorenzo! What are you doing here?


01:14:15.530 --> 01:14:18.124
Are you tired of all the Christmas games?


01:14:37.730 --> 01:14:41.609
It does not.
I already have too much to do.


01:14:41.730 --> 01:14:45.325
It is filled up in prison.
Nobody will notice anything.


01:14:52.610 --> 01:14:54.885
They were two.


01:14:55.010 --> 01:14:58.320
No, they killed almost
two of the Emperor's men.


01:14:58.450 --> 01:15:02.443
- Take the other two.
- No, I want those two.


01:15:24.570 --> 01:15:26.720
Who is it?


01:15:28.330 --> 01:15:30.048
Who am I?


01:15:33.730 --> 01:15:36.369
We are tired of being harmed.


01:15:36.490 --> 01:15:39.129
- And?
- Break it over.


01:15:41.970 --> 01:15:44.564
Also it.


01:16:33.330 --> 01:16:38.006
Milan has been so humiliated
that it is becoming unbearable.


01:16:38.130 --> 01:16:42.123
Brescia will help you
against the emperor...


01:16:42.250 --> 01:16:45.447
And to rebuild Milan.


01:16:45.570 --> 01:16:50.121
Mantua 'inhabitants will not
just look at...


01:16:50.250 --> 01:16:53.799
But you know what the Emperor would reply.


01:16:53.930 --> 01:16:59.800
He is right. The threat of
retaliation will scare people.


01:16:59.930 --> 01:17:04.640
How will the Lodi and Pavia act?


01:17:04.770 --> 01:17:09.241
We stick together.


01:17:09.370 --> 01:17:13.602
We stand united the Lombard states.


01:17:13.730 --> 01:17:16.688
We are not waiting Barbarossa retaliation.


01:17:20.290 --> 01:17:24.442
An army is invincible,
with a strong heart.


01:17:24.570 --> 01:17:27.323
Not least a wounded heart.


01:17:30.090 --> 01:17:32.524
Ride back to your cities...


01:17:32.650 --> 01:17:36.245
And ask young people whether they
want to continue living that way.


01:17:36.370 --> 01:17:39.567
You know what they will answer?


01:17:44.770 --> 01:17:48.888
- Better dead than slave.
- Better dead than slave.


01:17:50.610 --> 01:17:53.443
Death company from Milan.


01:17:54.570 --> 01:17:57.562
- Bergamo!
- Brescia!


01:17:57.690 --> 01:17:59.601
Mantua!


01:17:59.730 --> 01:18:04.246
Barbarossa trampling on our soil.


01:18:05.770 --> 01:18:11.322
It belonged to us,
so long as we can remember.


01:18:12.370 --> 01:18:18.240
We, the soldiers in death company,
vows to take our country back.


01:18:18.370 --> 01:18:23.444
We are fighting against the emperor
and never shows the enemy back.


01:18:23.570 --> 01:18:28.598
All towns must stand united
to defend the principal that we have.


01:18:28.730 --> 01:18:31.119
Our freedom.


01:18:31.250 --> 01:18:34.526
Our freedom! Freedom!


01:18:34.650 --> 01:18:36.288
Freedom!


01:19:08.090 --> 01:19:09.728
There you are!


01:19:17.850 --> 01:19:20.489
You too compassionate end, Eleonora!


01:19:20.610 --> 01:19:22.805
Where am I happy!


01:19:24.450 --> 01:19:26.918
Where is it nice to see you.


01:19:27.050 --> 01:19:31.487
I can not believe it's true.
Come and sit down.


01:19:35.410 --> 01:19:39.119
Tell why you have taken quite so.


01:19:40.970 --> 01:19:44.599
Alberto, and many like him,
have left their homes.


01:19:44.730 --> 01:19:49.281
They hide in the woods, waiting for more.


01:19:49.410 --> 01:19:52.561
They have taken a name...


01:19:55.930 --> 01:19:57.966
Death Company!


01:19:59.410 --> 01:20:02.049
Death company?


01:20:02.170 --> 01:20:06.049
It makes me think of evil.


01:20:06.170 --> 01:20:09.640
- Who are they?
- Hundreds of young men, Tessa.


01:20:09.770 --> 01:20:13.558
They will liberate Milan.


01:20:13.690 --> 01:20:18.081
You may soon come home again, sister.


01:20:18.210 --> 01:20:21.885
Do you think I can return to Milan?


01:20:22.010 --> 01:20:27.767
I think actually.
They are even prepared to die.


01:20:31.930 --> 01:20:35.161
Do you fear at Albertos behalf?


01:20:35.290 --> 01:20:38.043
Do you love him still?


01:20:39.890 --> 01:20:41.960
Yes.


01:20:42.090 --> 01:20:47.164
He also loves me.
He wants to marry me...


01:20:48.570 --> 01:20:51.642
- I saw...
- Do not worry about your visions.


01:20:51.770 --> 01:20:57.402
Listen to your heart.
What you do.


01:20:57.530 --> 01:21:00.806
Tell him that your answer is yes.


01:21:03.490 --> 01:21:07.688
Then one of us happy in the slightest.


01:21:21.890 --> 01:21:23.801
Eleonora!


01:21:50.290 --> 01:21:52.042
Take him!


01:21:54.690 --> 01:21:57.807
It's a woman! She is armed!


01:22:01.170 --> 01:22:04.082
What are you doing here?


01:22:04.850 --> 01:22:06.647
Give me the knife.


01:22:06.770 --> 01:22:09.125
Come here with the knife!


01:22:09.250 --> 01:22:12.879
We are Death's company,
and we become more and more.


01:22:13.010 --> 01:22:16.082
- What are you doing here?
- I was on my way home.


01:22:16.210 --> 01:22:19.441
- Milan lies in that direction.
- And then what?


01:22:19.570 --> 01:22:21.800
Let us be in peace.


01:22:26.650 --> 01:22:28.402
Listen carefully.


01:22:29.930 --> 01:22:33.969
We will soon be forced to go
to war against Barbarossa.


01:22:35.770 --> 01:22:38.079
Many of us will die.


01:22:43.050 --> 01:22:45.439
Marry me.


01:22:47.890 --> 01:22:50.006
Now...


01:22:54.370 --> 01:22:56.725
Do not try to escape.


01:22:56.850 --> 01:22:59.762
Why do you understand it?


01:22:59.890 --> 01:23:03.849
The world we grew up in,
no longer exists.


01:23:03.970 --> 01:23:07.929
Everything has changed. Alt.


01:23:11.970 --> 01:23:14.723
I love you.


01:24:04.850 --> 01:24:06.602
Shut up!


01:24:08.850 --> 01:24:12.638
Shut up, we must retrieve it,
belonging to the emperor!


01:24:13.410 --> 01:24:17.289
This is a monastery.
They have no right to come here.


01:24:17.410 --> 01:24:21.608
Shut up. Emperors Frederick
has given me the right.


01:24:21.730 --> 01:24:24.449
- Do not enter!
- Shut up!


01:24:26.890 --> 01:24:28.881
What?


01:24:29.010 --> 01:24:31.444
Have I done something wrong?


01:24:31.570 --> 01:24:34.084
What?


01:24:45.410 --> 01:24:47.640
Hurry.


01:24:51.730 --> 01:24:55.405
- What say you?
- It can be funny.


01:24:57.770 --> 01:25:00.887
- Look everywhere!
- What is it, sister?


01:25:01.010 --> 01:25:03.570
Everywhere!


01:25:07.490 --> 01:25:09.924
They resemble each other.


01:25:10.050 --> 01:25:15.249
Underwear can hide beautiful women.


01:25:15.370 --> 01:25:17.884
Abbess...


01:25:19.090 --> 01:25:21.445
How are you?


01:25:21.570 --> 01:25:25.279
- Abbess!
- I'm here.


01:25:25.410 --> 01:25:27.970
Ask them to unveil.


01:25:28.090 --> 01:25:32.959
In God's name...
What you ask is a sacrilege.


01:25:33.090 --> 01:25:37.083
- Otherwise, I do it myself.
- Kill me if you will.


01:25:37.210 --> 01:25:41.249
- Do not ask me about such things.
- As you will...


01:25:56.930 --> 01:25:59.364
Shall we start with that?


01:26:00.610 --> 01:26:05.001
It does not seem to be of
a particularly high quality.


01:26:11.890 --> 01:26:17.408
It was not so bad.
She would look good with long hair.


01:26:18.450 --> 01:26:20.566
What about her?


01:26:20.690 --> 01:26:23.443
See.


01:26:23.570 --> 01:26:25.083
No.


01:26:29.090 --> 01:26:31.160
Her?


01:26:36.570 --> 01:26:40.245
She is incredibly beautiful!


01:26:44.890 --> 01:26:47.120
Tessa?


01:26:48.570 --> 01:26:52.040
Is that you, Tessa?


01:26:54.970 --> 01:26:58.804
I've asked for that to happen.


01:26:59.650 --> 01:27:04.883
What do you want me to do?
I can do anything.


01:27:22.090 --> 01:27:24.650
Stop her!


01:27:27.330 --> 01:27:29.798
Stop her!


01:27:36.370 --> 01:27:38.281
No, do not do it!


01:27:40.970 --> 01:27:42.528
Tessa!


01:27:43.450 --> 01:27:46.647
No, no, no...


01:27:49.810 --> 01:27:54.964
Don't do it, Tessa.
I beg you!


01:27:55.090 --> 01:28:00.369
No, don't do it! I beg you.


01:28:02.450 --> 01:28:04.839
I love you.


01:28:05.610 --> 01:28:08.602
I love you with all my heart.


01:28:10.450 --> 01:28:15.240
I've never loved anyone
so much as I love you.


01:28:15.370 --> 01:28:17.679
Stay with me.


01:28:17.810 --> 01:28:23.009
I can change me.
I do everything you ask me.


01:28:23.130 --> 01:28:25.405
No, I beg you!


01:28:35.250 --> 01:28:37.764
Do not leave me.


01:28:37.890 --> 01:28:39.881
No!


01:28:42.730 --> 01:28:44.925
I ask you...


01:28:46.210 --> 01:28:48.280
I ask you...


01:28:49.290 --> 01:28:51.645
Give me your hand.


01:29:04.690 --> 01:29:06.487
No!


01:29:09.810 --> 01:29:11.641
Tessa!


01:30:07.170 --> 01:30:09.730
I loved her.


01:30:09.850 --> 01:30:12.444
I loved her.


01:30:17.650 --> 01:30:19.800
I loved her.


01:30:21.930 --> 01:30:24.000
I loved her.


01:30:28.490 --> 01:30:31.243
She cut his throat!


01:30:31.370 --> 01:30:36.444
- Touch her not!
- So you pay for.


01:30:36.570 --> 01:30:39.562
We get burnt on a bonfire!


01:30:47.170 --> 01:30:49.923
- Alberto!
- What is it, Nicola?


01:30:50.050 --> 01:30:53.486
Eleonora killed nearly Barozzi!


01:30:53.610 --> 01:30:58.126
- Where is she?
- On the way to Barbarossa in Alessandria.


01:30:58.250 --> 01:31:00.889
They burn her on a bonfire!


01:31:11.170 --> 01:31:13.001
Alberto!


01:31:14.490 --> 01:31:17.243
Let me go!


01:31:17.370 --> 01:31:21.841
Barozzi want you to come
so they can kill you!


01:31:22.730 --> 01:31:26.439
- Hold her!
- Do not touch me!


01:31:26.570 --> 01:31:29.368
Do not touch me! Damn you!


01:31:29.490 --> 01:31:32.562
Let me go!


01:31:34.530 --> 01:31:37.044
Get out!


01:31:37.170 --> 01:31:40.765
Get out of here!


01:32:22.690 --> 01:32:27.718
- Who is it?
- A witch. She just arrived.


01:32:33.930 --> 01:32:36.524
In you go, you witch!


01:32:41.570 --> 01:32:44.084
I survived.


01:32:45.010 --> 01:32:48.719
I do not think you will.


01:32:49.930 --> 01:32:52.967
I must look at when you burn.


01:33:01.970 --> 01:33:04.086
Bad news...


01:33:04.210 --> 01:33:09.842
We've tried to take the city
for several weeks. How's the tunnel?


01:33:09.970 --> 01:33:13.883
We dig only in the fighting to hide the sound


01:33:14.010 --> 01:33:16.444
And the rain makes it better.


01:33:16.570 --> 01:33:21.280
- Grave twice as much.
- The rivers are filled to bursting.


01:33:21.410 --> 01:33:25.244
If it rains more, the whole city flooded.


01:33:25.370 --> 01:33:28.680
Our men are tired,
and the rain ruining it for us.


01:33:28.810 --> 01:33:30.562
Shut up!


01:33:30.690 --> 01:33:36.845
We take the city before sunrise.
Make sure the tunnel is finished there.


01:33:39.210 --> 01:33:42.725
- They must not be worried.
- I'm not worried.


01:33:42.850 --> 01:33:45.205
Yes, she is here now.


01:33:45.330 --> 01:33:47.719
She is here.


01:33:47.850 --> 01:33:51.479
- Shut up.
- Your Highness...


01:33:51.610 --> 01:33:55.489
- It's an order!
- Do as she says.


01:33:58.210 --> 01:34:00.644
Close the door.


01:34:10.570 --> 01:34:12.845
Do you know who I am?


01:34:14.170 --> 01:34:18.288
You must be a very important person.


01:34:18.410 --> 01:34:21.561
They give the guards orders.


01:34:21.690 --> 01:34:27.640
I want to see the woman who dared to cut
the throats of the emperor's messenger.


01:34:27.770 --> 01:34:30.682
Next time I do it properly.


01:34:32.170 --> 01:34:35.560
There will be no next time.
You know very well.


01:34:37.050 --> 01:34:39.120
Tell me...


01:34:40.450 --> 01:34:43.328
Why did you do it?


01:34:43.450 --> 01:34:46.044
He killed my sister...


01:34:46.170 --> 01:34:50.129
And my husband are risking
their lives because of him.


01:34:51.770 --> 01:34:55.729
What do you mean?
In what way?


01:35:04.450 --> 01:35:07.522
What happened to your arm?


01:35:10.490 --> 01:35:12.924
I was struck by lightning.


01:35:15.210 --> 01:35:18.282
Deaths do not it?


01:35:29.130 --> 01:35:31.325
Who are you?


01:35:33.050 --> 01:35:35.359
Are you a witch?


01:35:37.850 --> 01:35:40.887
A witch! Let me out!


01:35:41.010 --> 01:35:43.478
Let me out!


01:35:43.610 --> 01:35:46.761
Open the door and shut me out!


01:35:46.890 --> 01:35:50.041
She's a witch!
I would not be here!


01:35:50.170 --> 01:35:54.288
- Let me out!
- Shut up! Get in there!


01:36:15.450 --> 01:36:20.968
They have no chance.
swords are in the perfect height.


01:36:30.490 --> 01:36:32.526
Well done, everybody.


01:36:39.970 --> 01:36:42.484
Hurry!


01:36:56.530 --> 01:36:58.998
Be quiet!


01:36:59.130 --> 01:37:01.690
Get ready.


01:37:08.250 --> 01:37:10.480
Besides all together!


01:37:11.930 --> 01:37:16.560
Germans have built a tunnel!


01:37:21.610 --> 01:37:25.728
We have been revealed!
The tunnel is closed.


01:37:32.690 --> 01:37:37.366
Light the war machines.
We pull us back.


01:37:39.410 --> 01:37:41.799
Alessandria damned!


01:37:55.570 --> 01:38:01.088
We draw us back to Pavia.
They are loyal to us.


01:38:01.210 --> 01:38:03.644
We can stay there for a while.


01:38:03.770 --> 01:38:08.480
They will communicate it
to their cousin, Leo Henry.


01:38:08.610 --> 01:38:12.125
We need new people.
He must help you.


01:38:12.250 --> 01:38:18.325
Henry wants more land. We have been
away from Germany for a long time.


01:38:18.450 --> 01:38:21.647
It was a good idea.


01:38:21.770 --> 01:38:23.761
I'm starting to pack.


01:38:23.890 --> 01:38:27.007
One more thing before we leave.


01:38:27.130 --> 01:38:30.645
Pardon the convict from Milan.


01:38:30.770 --> 01:38:34.206
Why do you worry about a peasant woman?


01:38:35.650 --> 01:38:40.883
She has incredible strength, Frederick.
They say that she is a witch.


01:38:41.010 --> 01:38:46.289
She has a scar on her arm
since she was hit by lightning.


01:38:46.410 --> 01:38:51.245
- What is it that weighs on you?
- She survived lightning.


01:38:51.370 --> 01:38:55.045
Challenge no heaven.
They may pardon her.


01:38:55.170 --> 01:38:58.560
She can bring you accidentally
If you burn her.


01:38:58.690 --> 01:39:02.205
Beatrix...We must punish her.


01:39:02.330 --> 01:39:08.200
If we burn her, it is for her sake.


01:39:33.050 --> 01:39:35.086
Be prepared.


01:39:52.850 --> 01:39:55.922
How's it going, cousin?


01:39:56.930 --> 01:40:00.286
Where is the army which they promised?


01:40:04.890 --> 01:40:07.450
Look at me, Your Majesty.


01:40:07.570 --> 01:40:13.042
I am 46 years old and has hurt everywhere.
I can not afford to fight anymore.


01:40:14.010 --> 01:40:19.323
I am much older than you,
but I will fight for the empire.


01:40:20.170 --> 01:40:23.640
I will also, Your Majesty.


01:40:30.370 --> 01:40:35.080
Here's some money that goes to many men.


01:40:35.210 --> 01:40:39.283
- It's my contribution.
- Stop it!


01:40:39.410 --> 01:40:44.404
You know very well that the emperor
doesn't need money, but an army.


01:40:44.530 --> 01:40:46.486
They should be ashamed of you!


01:40:46.610 --> 01:40:53.561
They were Saxony and Bavaria,
and he protected you from Prince's coup.


01:40:53.690 --> 01:40:58.366
Now that the emperor would ask you for help...


01:40:58.490 --> 01:41:02.278
You give him nothing but a mere trifle.


01:41:02.410 --> 01:41:04.844
What audacity!


01:41:04.970 --> 01:41:09.282
Your wife sounds like a man, Frederick.


01:41:23.130 --> 01:41:26.839
They are called the Lion...


01:41:30.010 --> 01:41:32.922
But you worthless.


01:41:35.130 --> 01:41:37.439
Now we are riding on!


01:41:49.130 --> 01:41:52.008
Stop complaining, you witch!


01:41:56.570 --> 01:42:01.519
- They had to go wait for me!
- It was the Empress's order.


01:42:01.650 --> 01:42:06.041
It does not matter as long as
she gets burned to death.


01:42:06.170 --> 01:42:08.081
Burn!


01:42:43.130 --> 01:42:46.247
Death Company!


01:42:47.250 --> 01:42:51.846
We are gathered here today
because we have a common dream.


01:42:51.970 --> 01:42:54.564
We dream of liberty.


01:42:54.690 --> 01:42:59.718
We have been robbed of our freedom.


01:43:01.010 --> 01:43:06.289
They robbed us our freedom to manipulate us...


01:43:06.410 --> 01:43:09.083
Divide us up...


01:43:09.210 --> 01:43:12.725
And know that our idle fears.


01:43:14.890 --> 01:43:18.121
Our common dream can unite us.


01:43:20.610 --> 01:43:28.119
We can reclaim our land and
our families can live in peace!


01:43:30.770 --> 01:43:34.524
Let us not fear for tomorrow.


01:43:34.650 --> 01:43:41.601
To have a day of freedom is worth
more than a hundred days of slavery!


01:43:48.730 --> 01:43:52.564
Together we must fight for our freedom.


01:43:52.690 --> 01:43:55.045
Freedom!


01:44:22.890 --> 01:44:25.040
Stop!


01:44:42.610 --> 01:44:46.205
Attack!


01:45:11.450 --> 01:45:13.247
See...


01:45:13.370 --> 01:45:15.759
It is Lombards.


01:45:21.490 --> 01:45:23.924
You too compassionate end!


01:45:44.970 --> 01:45:47.643
What the heck?


01:45:47.770 --> 01:45:51.524
Keep your positions.


01:45:53.330 --> 01:45:57.084
They have seen our Army
and dare not go on the attack.


01:45:57.210 --> 01:46:01.328
It's not good.


01:46:11.170 --> 01:46:13.001
Your Highness...


01:46:13.130 --> 01:46:17.885
The Milanese army is about
three kilometers away.


01:46:18.010 --> 01:46:21.798
- Can you see them?
- Milanese, are very stupid.


01:46:21.930 --> 01:46:24.160
We can handle them.


01:46:24.290 --> 01:46:30.206
It was only the cavalry, who attacked.
The infantry is not in sight.


01:46:30.330 --> 01:46:33.925
When we paralyze cavalry...


01:46:34.050 --> 01:46:37.645
Infantry will fall apart.


01:46:40.690 --> 01:46:46.560
I thank God every night that
he has given me a woman like you.


01:46:46.690 --> 01:46:52.481
- My place is with you, your grace.
- No, your place is with the children.


01:46:54.090 --> 01:46:57.127
Take the empress with the Pavia!


01:46:57.250 --> 01:47:00.128
We are going to war, my love.


01:47:00.250 --> 01:47:03.322
Attack!


01:47:07.090 --> 01:47:09.445
Keep your positions.


01:47:10.730 --> 01:47:12.925
Stay where you are.


01:47:13.050 --> 01:47:15.883
Wait, not yet.


01:47:16.010 --> 01:47:17.363
Wait!


01:47:23.650 --> 01:47:25.641
Not yet!


01:47:33.450 --> 01:47:35.247
Now!


01:48:06.170 --> 01:48:08.161
Now!


01:48:20.330 --> 01:48:22.605
Faster!


01:48:22.730 --> 01:48:25.369
Go on the attack!


01:48:32.330 --> 01:48:35.288
Attack! Ride forward!


01:48:47.290 --> 01:48:49.724
What is this?


01:48:49.850 --> 01:48:52.683
Up with the swords!


01:48:58.250 --> 01:49:00.559
Continue forward!


01:49:28.130 --> 01:49:31.247
Forward! Continue forward!


01:50:07.570 --> 01:50:09.481
Attack!


01:50:29.810 --> 01:50:31.926
Attack!


01:50:34.170 --> 01:50:35.762
Forward!


01:51:45.210 --> 01:51:47.041
You there!


01:52:42.330 --> 01:52:44.241
No!


01:52:47.290 --> 01:52:50.043
Lorenzo!


01:53:22.610 --> 01:53:26.762
Now you need to make
your corporate whore of hell!


01:53:28.930 --> 01:53:32.002
Look at me!


01:53:32.130 --> 01:53:35.042
You should see me when you die.


01:53:35.170 --> 01:53:39.641
- Kill me!
- You like!


01:53:39.770 --> 01:53:42.523
I have suffered greatly because of you!


01:53:42.650 --> 01:53:46.165
- My family!
- I have money!


01:53:46.290 --> 01:53:48.850
And my people!


01:53:48.970 --> 01:53:53.919
- Kill me. I beg you.
- I do this for Tessa.


01:53:54.050 --> 01:53:57.008
Can you feel it?


01:53:57.130 --> 01:54:01.328
I do this for my brothers!


01:54:03.730 --> 01:54:06.244
This...Look at me!


01:54:06.370 --> 01:54:09.521
I do this for my wife!


01:54:09.650 --> 01:54:12.005
Look at me!


01:54:13.530 --> 01:54:15.168
Do devil take you!


01:54:51.730 --> 01:54:53.960
Alberto!


01:54:58.050 --> 01:55:04.046
- Alberto...It is the emperor's horse.
- Yes. I can see.


01:55:05.730 --> 01:55:10.724
- Where is he?
- He must be here somewhere.


01:55:10.850 --> 01:55:13.887
- How should it be.
- I want to see the body.


01:55:14.010 --> 01:55:16.683
Barbarossa is dead.


01:55:21.810 --> 01:55:24.165
Give me the dagger.


01:56:04.810 --> 01:56:07.370
I miss her.


01:56:07.490 --> 01:56:12.883
You can not get Eleonora back.


01:56:15.210 --> 01:56:19.601
If she were here she would see you happy.


01:56:19.730 --> 01:56:25.885
You have achieved what you wanted.
The people got their freedom back.


01:56:42.090 --> 01:56:43.842
Look!


01:56:58.690 --> 01:57:01.124
Are you here?


01:57:03.610 --> 01:57:05.965
You live...


01:57:06.090 --> 01:57:08.206
You live!


01:57:10.610 --> 01:57:12.407
Alberto...


01:57:13.490 --> 01:57:20.043
- What are you doing here?
- Empress saved my life.


01:57:21.210 --> 01:57:24.327
They burned another woman in my place.


01:57:28.530 --> 01:57:30.998
You live!


01:57:33.370 --> 01:57:35.361
I love you.


01:57:36.650 --> 01:57:38.527
Freedom.


01:57:39.610 --> 01:57:42.443
- Freedom!
- Freedom!


01:57:42.570 --> 01:57:45.289
Freedom!


01:57:45.410 --> 01:57:47.480
Freedom!
